## 🧠 Why Multi-Agent Architecture?

A traditional chatbot typically sends every question to the same agent or prompt.

This project follows a **routing-based multi-agent architecture**, where different agents specialize in different types of tasks.

### Traditional Approach

```text
User
  ↓
Single AI Agent
  ↓
Response
```

### Multi-Agent Approach

```text
                    ┌──→ 📚 Study Agent
                    │
User → 🧠 Manager ──┼──→ 💻 Coding Agent
                    │
                    └──→ 🌐 General Agent
```

This architecture makes it easier to:

* Specialize agent behavior
* Create task-specific prompts
* Improve modularity
* Add new specialized agents
* Use different models or configurations for different tasks
* Scale the system into a larger AI application

