## ⚠️ Current Project Notes

The current `app.py` was developed iteratively and contains multiple testing sections and repeated Gradio interface implementations.

Before production deployment, the application should ideally be cleaned and refactored to:

* Keep only the final agent implementations
* Launch only one Gradio interface
* Load API keys securely from environment variables
* Remove unnecessary testing loops
* Remove duplicate code
* Ensure `requirements.txt` matches the actual imports
* Add appropriate deployment configuration

This will make the project more maintainable, efficient, and deployment-ready.

